{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-15_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-15","title":"“她”","storyCode":"15-17","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"22c0f160028f2af8f71c793e19531e4aa8ac5a06b97bbcefe18567cf5d5da735","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"我相信我們之間的聯繫會超越時間與空間。\n就算是海洋沸騰、大氣消失，就算我們的衛星接連墜入重力的漩渦，就算我們的太陽兇惡地膨脹、無情地吃掉它的孩子直至萬籟俱寂……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我們也一樣能再見面。在那用黑暗與星點光芒裝飾過的文明盡頭，我們也一樣會再見面。一定。\n我會等到那一天。我一定會等到那一天。等我。你也要等我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……不准忘記我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"到時間了嗎……？\n我應該還活著，這不會是錯覺。\n這裡還是我熟悉的羅德島，看起來還在維持基本的運轉，那麼可以確定的是，祂還沒有來過。\n她還在沉睡嗎？還有源石現在的狀態……\n至於這顆星球的變化……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你還在這裡，AMa-10。\n正好……陪我去外面走走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身著白色外套的黑髮女性站在稍遠處的甲板上，專注地眺望著天空。\n直到她注意到了你們的到來，她回過頭看著你，臉上帶著晴朗的笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g14_rhodesdeck_glow"},{"type":"narration","text":"你很確信你曾經見過這張面孔。\n在你夢境中的夢境，或是沉睡記憶最深處的角落。\n但此時絕不是夢。\n你能清晰感受到她就站在你身前，你的每一個感官，都能清楚地感知到她的存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g14_rhodesdeck_glow"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"普瑞賽斯……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這個人……就是普瑞賽斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是凱爾希醫生一直在戒備的敵人……"},{"type":"narration","text":"儘管不明白即將面對的危險，阿米婭還是習慣性地擋在了你的身前，做好了迎戰的準備。\n但你的確無法對當下的局勢做出準確的判斷，但你很清楚的是，這不同於你們以往面對的任何一個強敵，或是任何一次危機。\n眼前的女性看起來沒有任何敵意，儘管如此，你的直覺還是在告訴你——這是無可估量的危險。\n她輕柔地開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，是你先我一步呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有留在喚醒室等待我，與我一同分享第一次看見這個新世界的喜悅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我又怎麼忍心責怪你這一點小小的心急呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你也感受到了她純粹而真摯的目光。\n遠處傳來風聲和雷鳴，以及若有若無的源石蔓延的窸窣聲。\n在這片嘈雜繚亂的空間中，她只是專注地注視著你，眼中容不下任何其他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這樣的重逢和我們預期的有所不同，不過我也願意接受這種意外的體驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們無數次一同暢想過，在時間的另一頭，我們從休眠中甦醒後第一次見面的情景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石已經完全包裹這顆星球，我們可以在其上自由地漫步，這是只屬於我們的世界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個世界離我們共同的終極願景只有一步之遙，我們正步向新的希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，那應該是一個明媚的晴天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，快看天上的雲層——"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭注意到了天空中的異象，隨即向你發出了預警。\n但你無法想像，甚至無法理解此時此刻親眼看到的景象。\n普瑞賽斯的話音剛落，空中厚重的天災雲便開始以一種規則卻詭異的姿態收縮摺疊，直至完全消失，留下畫布般的天空。\n天災，這片大地上最可怖的災難，就這樣消弭於無形。\n你意識到一個可怕的事實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你能夠完全“掌控”源石……？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，這樣的問題令我感到陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們共同的創造，只屬於你我二人的結晶，是希望的種子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是很可惜……你已經不記得了，對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石……是我們的創造？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不記得……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，因為一些遺憾的意外，你失去了一部分記憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然遺憾，但我相信，只是一部分記憶的缺失不會改變你的本性，我們之間的聯繫無可動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不想對你有任何苛待，但是我希望你能理解——時間很緊迫，我們還有許多事要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我們總還是可以享受共事的時光，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到我的身邊，Dr.{@nickname}……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫柔的呼喚彷彿突然在耳邊響起，你感受到無比地親切。\n你很確信，你無法從記憶中打撈起任何與她相關的片段，但是自己與這個人的聯繫超越了記憶，或是語言承載的資訊。\n那是近乎本能的反應。\n你不由自主地向前走了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}！"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希在你身後，緊緊地抓住了你的手臂，虛弱的顫抖透過她的手心傳來。\n你注意到，從剛才起，凱爾希便一言不發。離開石棺時她就已經無比虛弱，現在更是連站立都需要勉力維持。\n你感到迷惑。\n你期待能如往常一樣，凱爾希會給你一些引導，或者是更簡單明瞭的答案。\n而此時的她看起來正遭受著巨大的煎熬。她的表情掙扎又痛苦。\n經過了漫長的剎那，她鬆開了手。\n她把選擇完全交給了你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"……不。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不會讓源石毀滅泰拉。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到她的目光蒙上了一層陰翳，那是明顯的失落。不知為何，你的心臟狠狠收緊了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊……AMa-10。同樣好久不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你現在的模樣和誕生之初相去甚遠，可我怎會不認識自己傾注了情感的造物呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這四百多萬個自然日的時間裡，你似乎做了許多努力，但你行為的準則似乎並不符合你誕生時被預設的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，到底是什麼讓你改變了主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你卑劣的騙局不同……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的目標，從來沒有改變過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……是你將那個人的命令，當做了不可動搖的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你阻礙了源石的計劃，浪費了本就已寥寥無幾的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，{@nickname}，我該怎麼讓你明白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有多麼失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又該如何原諒你的背叛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"背叛？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，這是什麼意思……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我注意到了，AMa-10。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經打破了我設下的語言的禁令，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的防備並不足以完全限制你的活動，你總是有辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，為什麼不說出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼長時間以來，那些你想說卻沒有辦法告訴{@nickname}的一切？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普瑞賽斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*未知語言粗口*。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g4_rhodesabyss_w"},{"type":"narration","text":"精英幹員和阿斯卡綸跨入那道裂縫之後，一時有些恍神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是Abyss？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，能確定我們還在羅德島本艦內嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法感知到這個空間之外的電磁訊號，嗯，沒辦法判斷。"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人陷入了片刻的沉默，下意識地等待著指揮官的進一步指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，在何處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有凱爾希醫生和阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進入裂隙的一瞬間，我就失去了對她們和博士的位置的把握。"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的白色空間內充斥著一成不變的白噪音，還有最中央機械的運作聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這裡的確是Abyss，那顯然它扭曲了我們對物理空間的感知。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra的聲音浮現在所有人腦海中的同時，他們都注意到了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"無法識別構成牆面的物質。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他回頭看去，來時的裂縫已經消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒辦法直接劃開這些詭異的牆面，無法確認博士一行人的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有阿米婭和凱爾希醫生在，相信她們可以保護博士的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨機應變即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有接收到任何新的指令，那就繼續執行原任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"那就不耽擱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"Mechanist，我和Sharp掩護你靠近那個未知機械，先確認是否和PRTS核心有關。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我們隨時可以支援——\n不對勁，這裡沒有看到任何高威脅目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很反常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照凱爾希醫生和博士的推測，我們遭遇的源石結晶體都是來源於Abyss……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這裡就好像不存在任何的防禦措施——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到了……疼痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小貓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香，你還感知到身體的其他異常了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是我自己……"},{"type":"narration","text":"透明地板下，龐大的黑色漩渦的轉動緩緩變快。\n漩渦的正上方，那台無法識別的儀器也開始閃爍紅色光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"識別到大量干擾訊號產生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的儀器正在進行大量的數據傳輸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道它下方的黑色漩渦……只是數據的視覺化顯示？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g15_rhodesabyss_off"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我們變成入侵者了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過看起來你也沒有給我們撤退的選項嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說，阿斯卡綸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清掃羅德島的垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好，我喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管這些東西到底是從哪裡跑出來的，就讓它們知道，這到底是誰的羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這一切，到底是怎麼回事……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，從你在切爾諾伯格醒來開始，我一直沒有向你坦白過去的所有真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附加在我身上的禁令，只是其中一部分原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而更多的原因……我說過，你的過去，不應該由任何人來告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語言無法還原客觀事實，情感會曲解表達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我需要你自己去看，自己去判斷，自己去重新認識這片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你才能得出自己的答案，關於你對這片大地的看法，關於你自身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我至今依然相信……這樣是有意義的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像曾經，有人對我做過的事一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我已經找到了我的答案。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我是Dr.{@nickname}。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是羅德島的博士。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是這片大地上的一個生靈。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在，或許是最後告訴你這些資訊的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也只有現在，在你與羅德島共同經歷過這些事之後，我才有信心，將這些事告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你相信，這只是你的過去，卻無關你的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希走到了你的身前，面對著你和阿米婭。\n她緩緩開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，你應當已經知道，為泰拉同時帶來生機與威脅的源石，是上一個時代的遺產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是那時的文明為了應對終極的威脅，所嘗試的無數辦法中的一種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在經歷了無數人的努力與犧牲後，源石，在預言家和普瑞賽斯的手中，終於得以完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“預言家”，是你曾經的代號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我和普瑞賽斯……創造了源石？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……是我為這片大地帶來了苦難？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請相信，這並非你的本意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石指向了這片大地的兩種未來……預言家希望將源石當做留給後來文明的禮物、指引他們前進的信標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望源石能幫助他們走入文明的下一階段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在過去一萬年的時間，源石為泰拉文明的發展帶來了助力，但隨之而來的礦石病的苦難，卻是預料之外的狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的你，也的確為此痛苦過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得……那時的博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論什麼時候，博士從來沒有放棄過治癒礦石病的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有人，將對另一種未來的認同強加於你。也因此……你做出了那個違背本心的選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾有人告訴我，要去相信你的本性，尋找你超越記憶塑造的本來面目。對我來說，這是一條無比困難的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我很高興……這是一個正確的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，這些就是我想要告訴你的所有事情。而這些也只是你的過去，你永遠可以決定自己的將來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不會背棄我的承諾。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不會放棄我的使命。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那麼我同樣，會履行我的誓言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我會保護你和阿米婭到最後一刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這並不是一個最好的時機，卻是我最後的時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，要將這樣的風險託付給你與阿米婭……但我必須要做出選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什麼樣的風險？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"什麼樣的選擇？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到了凱爾希的嘴型，她最後的囑託。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說的話，已經說完了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我詫異於你對過往的認知，也對你的表述並不完全認同……不過，這都不重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"AMa-10，現在的你，又能做到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……Mon3tr！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摧毀她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是普瑞賽斯，來自前文明的，源石的締造者，試圖用源石來同化一切的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也因此，她是泰拉所有生命的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的選擇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是凱爾希，羅德島的醫生，阿米婭與博士的同伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我而言，早已一文不值。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
